E AX3049 373-restrict-no-cast.ax:21:24-28 restriction-violated "`cast` in the body of `fabricates`, which claims `restrict(no-cast)`" ?"`no-cast` is LOCAL: a cast is an act this body performs, so it is refused where it is written, and a callee's casts are the callee's claim to make. `cast` is the one documented way to fabricate a value - a cast between two concrete types is unchecked - so under this restriction a type's guarantee holds, and without it, it holds of programs that did not write `cast`. Write the conversion the type system checks, or delete the tag"
